  "historyNote": "#5289, eff 1-1-92; ss and moved by #6391, eff 11-28-96 (from Liq 506.13), EXPIRED: 11-28-04 New. #8450, eff 10-21-05; ss by #10647, eff 7-24-14; ss by #13461, eff 10-13-22",
